parleymap 1
# Three Valleys: a small original board for testing the Purse and Dagger ruleset.
# Not meant to be played for fun. CC BY-SA 4.0 like the other maps here.
id valleys
name Three Valleys (test board)
license CC BY-SA 4.0
rules purse loans assassins
seasons Spring Summer Fall Winter
convoy coastal
start 1400
victory 5
power red Red #c8553d Redmark
power blue Blue #2f6690 Bluemark
power green Green #3a7d44 Greenmark
power auto Autonomous #8a8a8a Autonomous
x autonomous auto
prov rcap c red Redkeep
prov rfield l red Redfields
prov rtown c red Redhaven
prov bcap l blue Bluekeep
prov bfield l blue Bluefields
prov bport c blue Blueport
prov gcap c green Greenkeep
prov gfield l green Greenfields
prov mid l * Midmarch
prov pass l * The Pass
prov isle c * Lagoon Isle
prov bay s - The Bay
prov sound s - The Sound
city rcap walled 2 port
city rtown open 1 port
city bcap walled 1
city bport walled 1 port
city gcap walled 3 port
city mid walled 1
city isle walled 3 port single
army rcap: rfield rtown
army rfield: rtown mid pass
army rtown: pass
army mid: pass bfield gfield
army pass: bcap gfield
army bcap: bfield bport
army bfield: bport gfield
army gcap: gfield
fleet bay: rcap rtown bport isle sound
fleet sound: bport gcap isle
fleet rcap: rtown
unit red A rcap
unit red A rfield
unit red F rtown
unit blue A bcap
unit blue A bfield
unit blue F bport
unit green A gcap
unit green A gfield
unit auto G mid
x income red 1 1 2 3 4 5 6
x income blue 1 1 2 3 4 5 6
x income green 2 1 1 2 2 3 3
x income city:isle 1 1 1 2 2 3 3
x famine 5 - - - rfield - - - bfield - - -
x famine 7 - - mid - - rcap - - gfield - -
x famine 9 - - - - pass - - - - - -
x plague 6 - - - - - bcap - - - - -
x plague 7 - rtown - - - mid - - - isle -
x plague 8 - - - - gcap - - - - - -
x strait bport bay sound
